@Silver_Crusader
and
@Paradajz
I would love to take on your songs, but I’m at a point where I’ll probably have to pause on requests for a while…
I’m getting somewhat busy with the requests I have, and I also recently got the opportunity to take on a paid commission soon.
I’ll have to adjust the thread title here later today.
When I free up I’ll be sure to contact you both if you still need music! Thanks for your requests. Sorry I couldn’t make those happen!
To answer your question
@ZimXero
I believe all my music is posted as “All rights reserved”, but I don’t mind changing that for most of the songs.
Why do you ask?
